  <graph edgedefault="undirected">
    <node id="&quot;CHOLA EMPIRE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">ramdocs-0165-03603b88adca</data>
      <data key="d1">"Kulothunga Chola I was the ruler of the Chola Empire during the invasions of Kalinga."</data>
      <data key="d2">"UNKNOWN"</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;KULOTHUNGA CHOLA I&quot;">
      <data key="d0">ramdocs-0165-03603b88adca</data>
      <data key="d1">"Kulothunga Chola I was the ruler of the Chola Empire during the invasions of Kalinga."</data>
      <data key="d2">"UNKNOWN"</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;KALINGA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">ramdocs-0165-03603b88adca</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Chola Empire invaded Kalinga in 1097 and again in 1110, subjugating the kingdom and reducing it to a tributary state."</data>
      <data key="d2">"UNKNOWN"</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;VENGI&quot;">
      <data key="d0">ramdocs-0165-03603b88adca</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Chola Empire invaded Vengi, prompting the Kalinga forces to retaliate by invading the Eastern Chalukya kingdom, a vassal of the Chola Empire."</data>
      <data key="d2">"UNKNOWN"</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;EASTERN CHALUKYA KINGDOM&quot;">
      <data key="d0">ramdocs-0165-03603b88adca</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Eastern Chalukya kingdom, a vassal of the Chola Empire, was invaded by Kalinga forces in 1097."</data>
      <data key="d2">"UNKNOWN"</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ELLORE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">ramdocs-0165-03603b88adca</data>
      <data key="d1">"The troops of Kalinga were supported by the chief of Kolanu near Ellore during the 1097 invasion of the Eastern Chalukya kingdom."</data>
      <data key="d2">"UNKNOWN"</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PALLAVA CHIEF, KARUNAKARA TONDAIMAN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">ramdocs-0165-03603b88adca</data>
      <data key="d1">"Karunakara Tondaiman, a Pallava chief, led the forces that defeated the army of Kalinga in 1110 CE."</data>
      <data key="d2">"UNKNOWN"</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ANANTAVARMAN CHODAGANGA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">ramdocs-0165-03603b88adca</data>
      <data key="d1">"Anantavarman Chodaganga, the king of Kalinga, fled after the defeat in the 1110 CE invasion by the Cholas."</data>
      <data key="d2">"UNKNOWN"</data>
    </node>
